      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "5. Validate model output\n\nOnly digest Crumb IDs, code refs and\nsummary reference IDs survive.\nDrop unsupported diagnoses; clamp ranks\nand strengths; cap summary at 1200 chars.\nHash reuse skips unchanged synthesis.",
      "rawText": "5. Validate model output\n\nOnly digest Crumb IDs, code refs and\nsummary reference IDs survive.\nDrop unsupported diagnoses; clamp ranks\nand strengths; cap summary at 1200 chars.\nHash reuse skips unchanged synthesis.",
