      "originalText": "6. Compose deterministic Case File\n\nmerge previous + current Crumbs by ID\nretain ≤500 Crumbs, ≤250 Trail entries\nsource health + links + high-signal count\nbuild chronology-based candidate sequence\nattach AI complete/unavailable state",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
