      "originalText": "PostgreSQL system of record\n\ncases • case_origin_receipts • work_items\ncrumbs • trail_entries • outbox\ncase_signatures • patterns\npattern_occurrences\n\nWork lease: 2 min; exponential retry ≤60s\nOutbox lease: 1 min; exponential retry ≤300s",
