      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Web / SignalR\n\nPublish CaseUpdated(version, sections)\nand CaseStatusChanged.\nClient joins the Case group, ignores stale\nversions, refetches with ETag and uses 5s\npolling when disconnected or Case File is pending.",
      "rawText": "Web / SignalR\n\nPublish CaseUpdated(version, sections)\nand CaseStatusChanged.\nClient joins the Case group, ignores stale\nversions, refetches with ETag and uses 5s\npolling when disconnected or Case File is pending.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "web",
      "originalText": "Web / SignalR\n\nPublish CaseUpdated(version, sections)\nand CaseStatusChanged.\nClient joins the Case group, ignores stale\nversions, refetches with ETag and uses 5s\npolling when disconnected or Case File is pending.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
