      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Slack — one durable message per Case\n\nOutbox worker loads the latest committed Case + Case File.\nFirst delivery: chat.postMessage; save returned timestamp. Later: chat.update.\nBlocks include service/state/agent/urgency, Pattern match, up to 3 diverse\ntop Crumbs, AI summary or deterministic fallback, candidate sequence,\nsource-health icons and a live Case File link. A delayed collecting check may add\na Rebuild Case File button; Socket Mode acknowledges and queues a fresh work item.",
      "rawText": "Slack — one durable message per Case\n\nOutbox worker loads the latest committed Case + Case File.\nFirst delivery: chat.postMessage; save returned timestamp. Later: chat.update.\nBlocks include service/state/agent/urgency, Pattern match, up to 3 diverse\ntop Crumbs, AI summary or deterministic fallback, candidate sequence,\nsource-health icons and a live Case File link. A delayed collecting check may add\na Rebuild Case File button; Socket Mode acknowledges and queues a fresh work item.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "slack-output",
      "originalText": "Slack — one durable message per Case\n\nOutbox worker loads the latest committed Case + Case File.\nFirst delivery: chat.postMessage; save returned timestamp. Later: chat.update.\nBlocks include service/state/agent/urgency, Pattern match, up to 3 diverse\ntop Crumbs, AI summary or deterministic fallback, candidate sequence,\nsource-health icons and a live Case File link. A delayed collecting check may add\na Rebuild Case File button; Socket Mode acknowledges and queues a fresh work item.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
