      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Failure behavior: Crumb-source errors become unavailable results; AI errors become synthesis=unavailable; Pattern errors become unavailable.\nSlack errors stay in the outbox. None erases the committed deterministic Case File.",
      "rawText": "Failure behavior: Crumb-source errors become unavailable results; AI errors become synthesis=unavailable; Pattern errors become unavailable.\nSlack errors stay in the outbox. None erases the committed deterministic Case File.",
      "textAlign": "center",
